Small, light and always up for another lap, the AE86 brings Toyota's lively rear-wheel-drive coupe spirit to Hina's Drift Club. Its naturally aspirated engine loves to rev, while deliberately modest power gives you room to learn the dance between throttle and steering.

This Trueno comes with a complete drift setup, friendly gearing and its own Hina's Drifters AE86 tyres. It's the welcoming member of the club: ready for your first slides, rewarding tidy transitions and just as happy coming back for one more go. Hop in and find your rhythm. Tofu delivery experience optional.
